cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the manuscript and this archive."
type: software
title: "DiagEx — reproducibility package for zero-shot P&ID-to-DEXPI digitization with a vision-language agent"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for an evaluation of DiagEx, a pure LLM-vision agent
  (Claude Opus 4.7) that extracts structured graphs from industrial
  schematics — Phase 1 (NL queries), Phase 2 (P&ID → DEXPI 2.0), an ablation
  that disables tile zoom, and a GPT-4.1 single-shot baseline. The package
  contains the diagex source, the evaluation harness, ground-truth corpora
  for 10 public P&IDs, final results CSVs, replay cassettes for offline
  re-derivation, and the manuscript PDF.
